    "Which categories and branches are below gross margin plan this week, and by how many basis points?",
    "Where is price realisation lowest \u2014 which branches or categories are giving the biggest discounts?",
    "How much inventory has been sitting more than 180 days, and in which branches?",
    "What is our current DSO, and which customer segments are driving it?",
    "Which overdue accounts (30+ days past due) represent the largest collections exposure?"
